  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This is a rather simple game - just survive as much as you can. But on the arena there may be one or more Conditions (“Conds” for short) which, every 10 seconds, affect the game in some way (either good, like giving you a sword, or bad, like freezing you in an ice block). At least one Cond is always present: the Conditioner, which spawns other Conds every 10 seconds. Part of the fun is trying to find out what each Cond do :-)"
    }
  ],
